2026-07-28T07:05:56.3240460Z +     "manner.\n",
2026-07-28T07:05:56.3240814Z +     "\n",
2026-07-28T07:05:56.3241760Z +     "This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite\n",
2026-07-28T07:05:56.3242910Z +     "that runs continuously in our own CI; see <https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-r>.\n",
2026-07-28T07:05:56.3243663Z +     "\n",
2026-07-28T07:05:56.3244394Z +     "To run the test suite locally, set the environment variable before checking:\n",
